{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55337","headline":"书翠崖（一作「岩」）寺壁 · 欧阳持","name":"书翠崖（一作「岩」）寺壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎笑堂前九节筇，闲来无事得从容，时闻雷护千年橘，夜听风传万壑松。\n茅屋人家芳草合（一作「外」），竹房僧住翠微浓（一作「中」）。\n一蓑烟雨归来晚，遥听云间起暮钟。\n（见《江西诗微》卷三。\n）（按：今人编选之《滕王阁诗选》，自道光三十年刊涂阑玉辑《西山志》中录该诗，略有异文，注一作者即据该书。\n《西山志》未见。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳持","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}